00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:27.880
this function will get executed
every time the state changes,

138
00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:33.880
but it's only going to have a meaningful
thing to do once the readyState is 4,

139
00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.230
and the status is 200.

140
00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:37.810
And we'll see a concrete
example of that in a second

141
00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:40.180
where we're going to be
