144
00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:53.380
This is just a simple way to do this.

145
00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:57.527
We're basically creating a GET
request of a particular URL.

146
00:06:57.527 --> 00:06:59.110
Don't worry about what the true means.

